{"abstract":"In this dataset paper we introduce PROCAT, a novel e-commerce dataset containing expertly designed product catalogues consisting of individual product offers grouped into complementary sections. We aim to address the scarcity of existing datasets in the area of set-to-sequence machine learning tasks, which involve complex structure prediction. The task's difficulty is further compounded by the need to place into sequences rare and previously-unseen instances, as well as by variable sequence lengths and substructures, in the form of diversely-structured catalogues. PROCAT provides catalogue data consisting of over 1.5 million set items across a 4-year period, in both raw text form and with pre-processed features containing information about relative visual placement. In addition to this ready-to-use dataset, we include baseline experimental results on a proposed benchmark task from a number of joint set encoding and permutation learning model architectures.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Jurewicz, Mateusz","Derczynski, Leon"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382475"],"event":{"acronym":"NeurIPS","title":"Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Complex Structure Prediction","E commerce Dataset","PROCAT","Product Catalogues","Set to Sequence Machine Learning"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"procat product catalogue dataset for implicit clustering permutation learning and structure prediction","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/86429501/PROCAT_Product_Catalogue_Dataset_for_Implicit_Clustering_Permutation_Learning_and_Structure_Prediction.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-382475","ids":["itu-50a2fe24-3383-40c9-82fc-09225a500aa3"],"keyword":["Complex Structure Prediction","E-commerce Dataset","PROCAT","Product Catalogues","Set-to-Sequence Machine Learning"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-4FBB246863E7428624E88212809E3F3E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/86429501/PROCAT_Product_Catalogue_Dataset_for_Implicit_Clustering_Permutation_Learning_and_Structure_Prediction.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science","IT University of Copenhagen, Data Science, Machine Learning","IT University of Copenhagen, Data Science, NLPnorth"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mateusz","key":"jurewiczpau","last":"Jurewicz","name":"Jurewicz, Mateusz","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Leon","key":"derczynskipau","last":"Derczynski","locid":"785a7089-e58e-4aaa-986d-ae0e615ba508","name":"Derczynski, Leon","orcid":"0000-0002-8656-3431","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.6084/m9.figshare.14709507","edition":"2021","status":"p","subtitle":"Datasets and Benchmarks Track","title":"Thirty-fifth Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems","volume":"1"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-50a2fe24-3383-40c9-82fc-09225a500aa3"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"PROCAT: Product Catalogue Dataset for Implicit Clustering, Permutation Learning and Structure Prediction","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-382475","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
