{"abstract":"This paper presents a framework of opportunities and barriers/risks between the two research fields Natural Language Processing (NLP) and Human-Computer Interaction (HCI). The framework is constructed by following an interdisciplinary research-model (IDR), combining field-specific knowledge with existing work in the two fields. The resulting framework is intended as a departure point for discussion and inspiration for research collaborations.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Inie, Nanna","Derczynski, Leon"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-385019"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Framework","Human Computer Interaction","Interdisciplinary research","Natural Language Processing","Research collaboration"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"an idr framework of opportunities and barriers between hci and nlp","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"https://www.aclweb.org/anthology/2021.hcinlp-1.16/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-385019","identifier":[{"id":"85118938822","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-ffe0cf16-be5c-4cb0-8a2e-1b4caeffaa30"],"keyword":["Framework","Human-Computer Interaction","Interdisciplinary Research","Natural Language Processing","Research Collaboration"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F80735140226464C6BB2C14714CC53A5"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"https://www.aclweb.org/anthology/2021.hcinlp-1.16/","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/85902110/An_IDR_Framework_of_Opportunities_and_Barriers_between_HCI_and_NLP.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Center for Computing Education Research","IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science","IT University of Copenhagen, Data Science, Machine Learning"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Nanna","key":"iniepau","last":"Inie","locid":"e23e8096-59cb-4ef6-af48-ce9d806fd1eb","name":"Inie, Nanna","orcid":"0000-0002-5375-9542","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Leon","key":"derczynskipau","last":"Derczynski","locid":"785a7089-e58e-4aaa-986d-ae0e615ba508","name":"Derczynski, Leon","orcid":"0000-0002-8656-3431","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"101-108","publisher":"Association for Computational Linguistics","status":"p","subtitle":"HCINLP","title":"Proceedings of the First Workshop on Bridging Human–Computer Interaction and Natural Language Processing"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-ffe0cf16-be5c-4cb0-8a2e-1b4caeffaa30"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"An IDR Framework of Opportunities and Barriers between HCI and NLP","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-385019","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Abusive phenomena are commonplace in language on the web. The scope of recognizing abusive language is broad, covering many behaviors and forms of expression. This work addresses automatic detection of abusive language in Russian. The lexical, grammatical and morphological diversity of Russian language present potential difficulties for this task, which is addressed using a variety of machine learning approaches. Finally, competitive performance is reached over multiple domains for this investigation into automatic detection of abusive language in Russian.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Saitov, Kamil","Derczynski, Leon"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-383138"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU"],"country":["Russia"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Innopolis University"],"keyword":["Abusive language detection","Lexical diversity","Machine learning","Morphological analysis","Russian language processing"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"abusive language recognition in russian","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"https://www.aclweb.org/anthology/2021.bsnlp-1.3/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-383138","identifier":[{"id":"85119578848","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-8010224b-157e-46e4-94ab-3e1ac7877986"],"keyword":["Abusive language detection","Lexical diversity","Machine learning","Morphological analysis","Russian language processing"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-3FFA26D24F16D863A129EC3C101C8BCA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/85902105/_EACL_2021_Abusive_Language_Recognition_in_Russian.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"rem","url":"https://www.aclweb.org/anthology/2021.bsnlp-1.3/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"ru","key":"innopolis university","loc":["Russia","Europe, Non-EU"],"name":"Innopolis University","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science","IT University of Copenhagen, Data Science, Machine Learning","IT University of Copenhagen, Data Science, NLPnorth"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kamil","key":"saitovpau","last":"Saitov","name":"Saitov, Kamil","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Leon","key":"derczynskipau","last":"Derczynski","locid":"785a7089-e58e-4aaa-986d-ae0e615ba508","name":"Derczynski, Leon","orcid":"0000-0002-8656-3431","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"20-25","publisher":"Association for Computational Linguistics","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 8th Workshop on Balto-Slavic Natural Language Processing"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-8010224b-157e-46e4-94ab-3e1ac7877986"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Abusive Language Recognition in Russian","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-383138","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
